      "id": "en.n8.class-47.t01",
      "en": "My brother has gotten a new job, and he starts on the weekend.",
      "es": "Mi hermano ha conseguido un nuevo trabajo y empieza el fin de semana.",
      "explanationEs": "EE. UU.: has gotten (conseguir) y on the weekend. RU: has got y at the weekend.",
