    {
      "id": "en.n8.class-47.t04",
      "en": "The colour of the theatre is red; in the US it is the color of the theater.",
      "es": "El color del teatro es rojo; en EE. UU. es «the color of the theater».",
      "explanationEs": "Ortografía: -our/-or (colour/color) y -re/-er (theatre/theater).",
